        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "6e6127aa-d8e4-51b1-a6f0-f4ef9d14a278",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ken Leung, Scott Buck\n- TV series: Inhumans, Lost\n- Film roles: Detective Stephen Sing, Miles Straume, Admiral Statura, Kid Omega, Karnak\n- Organizations: ABC, Marvel Comics\n- Concepts: Inhumans\n\nFacts:\n- Ken Leung was born on January 21, 1970, and he is an American actor.\n- Ken Leung is best known for playing Miles Straume in \"Lost,\" Admiral Statura in \"Star Wars: The Force Awakens,\" Detective Stephen Sing in \"Saw,\" and Kid Omega in \"X-Men: The Last Stand.\"\n- Marvel's Inhumans is an American television series created for ABC by Scott Buck and based on the Marvel Comics race called the Inhumans.\n- Ken Leung portrays the Marvel Comics character Karnak, a member of the Inhumans, in the ABC television series \"Inhumans.\"\n- The ABC television series \"Inhumans\" premiered in September 2017.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
